Modifications (added by the junoscfg project, 2026-10-10)

This directory holds a copy of three configurations from the repository above,
taken at commit ef889c28e687155388823ac09be5452701f97ef9, and files derived
from them:

- sources/<name>.conf.gz: the configuration as published, unmodified, gzipped.
- <device>/<name>.{conf,json,set,xml}.gz: derived works. Each is what a Juniper
  device printed after the unmodified source was loaded on it (`load
  override` in `configure private`, never committed) and shown with `show`,
  `show | display xml`, `show | display json` and `show | display set`. The
  device reformats the configuration, drops statements its platform does not
  support, adds `## Warning` comments, and re-encrypts secrets.

The paths in the source repository are in ../manifest.json. These files serve
as test data for junoscfg and are distributed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0, in ./LICENSE, not under junoscfg's own licence.
